   What Dragontamer said, but also: In Zork the sword glowed blue in the
presence of a troll and a thief, but NOT grues, and there were no orcs
in Zork AFAIK. (Yes, Sting is a Tolkien reference, and Tolkien *was*
orcs, but if you're going to drag Zork into it, I'm going to nitpick. ;)

   Also, the brass lantern in Nethack is a tribute to Adventure, not Zork
--- or in addition to Zork; after all, Adventure came first, and pretty 
much every dungeon-crawl text adventure features a brass lantern. See
http://www.ifwiki.org/index.php/Brass_lantern

Anyway, I base this assertion on the message "Your lamp has run out of
power.", which comes from Adventure --- and of course all the other
direct quotes from Adventure in the rest of the game. I can't think of
any Zork tributes in Nethack, although if one were to be added, the
grue would be the obvious choice!

